    "title": "Judge declares mistrial in Lubbock murder trial over late video evidence - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KCBD Staff ,\n6 hours ago LUBBOCK, Texas (KCBD) - A judge declared a mistrial Wednesday in the murder trial of Victor Yanez before opening statements could begin, citing a failure by law enforcement to timely disclose hours of video evidence. Judge William Eichman of the 364th District Court granted the defense’s motion for a mistrial... Read full article",
